From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 08:55:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(property): consolidate property workspace into six
 focused tabs
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Property Workspace 5.0 IA rebuild of /properties/[id] — presentation only, every
selector/slot/child component preserved (no engine, data, or business-logic change).

- Nine "admin page" tabs → SIX focused workspaces: סקירה · שיווק · קונים ולידים ·
  בעל הנכס · יומן · מסמכים. "מרכז שליטה" + "מרכז ניהול" merge into סקירה; "ציר זמן"
  and "פרטים ונתונים" are no longer primary tabs.
- The full cinematic hero now renders on סקירה ONLY; every other tab gets a compact
  sticky property header (thumbnail + title + price + status + עריכה) so switching
  tabs no longer costs half a viewport. Workspace nav is sticky.
- סקירה folds the former ציר זמן + פרטים content into collapsible sections
  (מחיר ושוק · פעילות הנכס · פרטים מלאים ותמונות) so nothing is lost while the
  overview stays scannable — a summary, not a dashboard-below-a-dashboard.
- Property editing routes to the dedicated /edit (details is not a workspace);
  back-link points at /my-properties (the canonical inventory).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Cm5NAh92cekdimerQbEsCW
